{
  "_help": [
    "One entry per agency. Set enabled=false to switch an agency off.",
    "adapter: cmrl | cmrl_press | sample_metro | mbta | rss  (rss works for any RSS 2.0 or Atom feed of notices)",
    "operator_type: Government | Private",
    "{demo_base_url} is replaced with this app's own address (used by the demo sources).",
    "Before enabling a new real agency: check its robots.txt and terms and record them in docs/SOURCE_APPROVAL.md."
